OL,3,GNEWSAWe live with a 'heavy heart'
OL,4,Aknowing my brother's death was
OL,5,Apreventable
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe sister of a man who died after
OL,8,Fwaiting hours for an ambulance has said
OL,9,Fhis family lives every day with a
OL,10,F"heavy heart" in the knowledge that his
OL,11,Fdeath was preventable.
OL,13,FLee Gannon died at the Royal Victoria
OL,14,FHospital in February 2022 after
OL,15,Fexperiencing breathing problems at his
OL,16,Fhome in Belfast. A post-mortem
OL,17,Fexamination found he died from lobar
OL,18,Fpneumonia - a severe bacterial
OL,19,Finfection.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
