OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWe live with a 'heavy heart'
OL,4,Aknowing my brother's death was
OL,5,Apreventable
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 25-year-old's family called an
OL,8,Fambulance but the call was not deemed
OL,9,Fas a Category 1 emergency and Lee did
OL,10,Fnot reach hospital for almost four
OL,11,Fhours after the initial 999 call.
OL,13,FDelivering the inquest verdict, the
OL,14,Fcoroner said the delay "materially
OL,15,Fcontributed to his premature death".
